  <item>
    <title>S4E14 草原硬核选美大赛：小羊角逐、现场拍卖，老王拿下参赛小羊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6adef7dec96c8942ec1258f1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6adef7dec96c8942ec1258f1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 06:53:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期好玩了，老王将带我们去锡林郭勒，在那里每年会举办小羊的选美比赛，民间自发举办的比赛，但是看起来非常正式和专业。跟着老王的朋友三舅，我们将了解到真正牧民的生活。从大清早开始就开始劳作，挤牛奶，做丰盛的早餐。早餐结束，从西乌珠穆沁旗穿梭到东乌珠穆沁旗的萨麦苏木，来到赛马场，也就是选美比赛的现场。第一天大家陆陆续续把小羊运到场地，第二天比赛正式开始。牧民们会穿着非常正式的民族服出席。经过几轮的角逐，冠亚军羊产生，最后进入拍卖阶段。老王也买到了一只属于自己的小羊。明年比赛，这只小羊会再次参与比赛。</span></p><p><span>明年的8月，有小伙伴想一起去看吗？如果大家有兴趣，我们将在明年邀请听友一起去玩~</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopIPVKuD75mozbL8PrpcJAqXtyK.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvX8yRAGRvbJfMAnGtS9hIetpZpX.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2vZXSYnDHBwtLp6nQWBY8FquEl.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZ1Fh26cnVOQpb2xZG82C42qrNv.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv-8Ry8dL_wlnV7TeXytgL9DwvVP.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjBxV0-8aG8f7K_SiMH0p8ctFd_.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCk7XuM2czyssT_XshPqMUWlnDp.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgnsNulaMRO6t84g8hoLMETq48Mp.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0P6AsRF_bDloQ4Fjsk-DsQvjRu.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZ1UFLiaDbJvD6jFI32K2mzVTac.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7bGWPo-jObO3q0kYIfPStcRVhZ.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fotl-ir7Ec4ImagXfYxjIxXR6cGl.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBIxrhgpow7u_fGk5v0QUWFPr9O.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVFDQyz00AJGwGwRmO2VRPZBjeJ.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZnkysHnsdZaTV4uuBUI3WRyjcI.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5Ab59zaN1IhIBLDlXVWF3IRi2D.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvb-lUijjYXpeYmvd1MLQrx5cpDg.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6DYNMGtnxKnWhMdlYsOT5mMfd1.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FggP7gc6pJzqjCGbiUHaB2Iw9Xz7.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk72pXUZgSKa95cz3u_gQ1Y__SZ1.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnJvucCJRw1yqHqLQMqiIVdsNphD.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fts4ZIWx1-1hVpXLuPHnnf3Cp5xd.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmnbWOoVSlkthrih60V3d2W9MQbj.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRRwrP_g5WmkpkzgdHJ9qt