  <item>
    <title>S4E13 帕米尔高原，解锁祖国的西陲边境风光</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6acce0e3e742e36efcc1e4e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6acce0e3e742e36efcc1e4e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:39:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>响应时代，我们也开启视频播客咯~</span></p><p><span>本期老王带你解锁南疆自驾路线，聊聊帕米尔高原怎么抵达，从国道314开始，先来到瓦罕走廊，行走 4000 米以上高原，探访西陲第一所。沿途打卡白沙湖、公格尔峰、慕士塔格峰，还有老王一时记不起名字的卡拉库里湖。</span></p><p><span>驶入塔县，感受海拔 3000 米以上的田园风光，错过了石头城，但来到红其拉甫国门，打卡班迪尔蓝湖、帕米尔之眼、木吉火山。还会走进莎车叶尔羌汗国王陵，聆听十二木卡姆，最推荐的是叶城的地道美食。行程还延伸至西极乌恰县、天山托木尔大峡谷，最后探访库车龟兹古国。如此行程，直接抄作业！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnCD9WBLbV5TPtvZieYtrkfiiXXY.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpUNmQPmYWpVRLv0QhQG9CMm_Wlv.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjNEEILI_Mbqv2wYuqncxq4T45y.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhDR_JV4cNRqgRtZAsFcxqwEoD1_.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhD5k5DX09AjEMnKFVFZD62B56Pj.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnOaXRistHhND9003JrnTvGl-A9J.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1GXgfRfD29tFE2XPsjG44epww0.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fthe6FEbHm1etGVUJ6jv8ZzhcsbD.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4pZtrPpagWDU1COVMYBGUgRlJy.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6-ejBvNSORBccGfYj4KFw3fCPJ.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAP4arDWC-yEXbGFsJicIX_76ob.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvXtYoWi5yo-Q_iT1d3UsJQhYDcn.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiegWUIb_tJRkVBwGQynlus4MvKj.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoiyRHgyDWiVwe_wAD64W2fCvyKG.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNvKMXbdbL6gbs5wol49BTYerFG.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOhS1PlCOjX6zjicHMR1RB48gYW.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs1w4n_SE3FHi5HbbYxoFQ6VSBZT.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXIcyVswjVzdzCzxzMe82KiH-At.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkhu88PtL45i1PPvedHdYdRyA107.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjRJ2_d9awm4E27amzjQm4hhAK7H.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fro-xdJUNLOE0MZfTUJcHiKPYzgc.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FowGYc4GdVXiaUp-jf3JHH-ncJ6a.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcEKfFzPOQRtjQdiWdSP-pHdyF4.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnoC__h1TfZjUaSigOzpf5BYgujK.JPG"><