    <title>S4E12 国宝沃土-运城，盐池边的华夏过往</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a7b46bd36641f136d86c0be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a7b46bd36641f136d86c0be</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:10:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>地下文物看陕西，地上文物看山西。而山西国保单位最多的地方在运城。运城拥有中原地区唯一的盐湖，是重要的物资运输枢纽。这里名人辈出，关羽的故乡，可以去关帝祖庙看看。王之涣《登鹳雀楼》描写的鹳雀楼，深藏中华瑰宝的永乐宫，稷王庙、板枣公园都值得大家深度游览。当然老王也提到了运城的美食、产业，还有历史。</span></p><p><span>📣老王的纪录片节目《东升乡土》  在各个视频平台上线了，请大家搜索观看哦~~还会有随机福利掉落哦。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqppFiGkc53Z4C1whJwvtHQj7Ky-.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqqw9wIosB5tGUoaUDmtU_AFPYuv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl5ZETZ_Z3OgnVmHK9ovKPY08viG.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foz9XY_0kUaPd-7SLmduHXu4gNp1.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrfTS80Myysu_Fghp_EK0uQnQbh0.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiV72DxK6oyk5Myd7PDFNRGKLGhp.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZCEc8S_pkNa-j2gwQmuo74ZWPr.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrIY8PVZEDz8HTVMY4H4yI5ILxr6.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaXpKCmTaK3k5ej0dSgQc1QhP88.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp253O8XrZ-IRo2aKmVHUd8GKhA9.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmdtTt2pEPPIS8kTRIOouO_wuSlv.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibAcOf5AL3X2TSIXRTUnP2qBFxE.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpEtLDS-ZJtXidvkkyF3AsMUdyno.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFlVKYI5yrIrgN1Li3ENwCmqxKU.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnY6tKD13-USc1DiIQNzcsF7D_pt.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkdc9jp2oX_yWFP6VVu6e_LIcSEX.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiOeUAPe35s3RfEZlhOVibSyynXV.jpg"><p><span>本期主播：老王 托粒</span></p><p><span>后期：托粒  拍摄：老王 封面：老王</span></p>]]></description>
