    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a61d91ca3fec224d5a227d9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 09:13:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>说到丽江，大家一定有印象，而提到宁蒗县，又是个陌生的名字。但如果提起泸沽湖，大家就会恍然大悟，原来它在宁蒗。宁蒗的苹果、土豆、米线、饵块作为美食更会被人所知。而真正来到宁蒗，整座城的足浴店，及时享乐的民风让人意想不到。老王深入探访彝族菜市场感受当地人的生活，通过和摩梭族的交流，了解母系社会特殊的走婚文化，摩梭人的待客之道也始料未及。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv6Z9VzFQzu6ivGDlv0eKd2_MbLW.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjvNVrEHmOch-o1mxf8Ss25ly2oo.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhfN0TucjDtfzjrOFbEDIdwHuUBK.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknNf9vnWb41kYRb7Ol2DV9Ht6pC.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpcTncGUmTBcjJcJBurddFJ7Dhn8.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIDFSV1j8xm-OBWBP9ilg8fCQwM.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj-ema1VSRD4QWq1S9eDR9rZqglz.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuMa8G7Cq0LFbdbVExs-0LeYgvCr.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtO6Zv6kf0wtaWrhM7-SE8mMMh9b.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiDDARdk-HPtgI3QjNtbDNTPhIHK.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfzE-eRji9REP0OjywJXi-Da8Fw.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFhV-t78hHr4DhZUV04eQtwV4f3.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frp9UBkYtoSiDTrbfgntMRy7F8Va.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiG9fFAiwn5C0JtOKzq8ic1dgUAz.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomWbt96z_Tj3NSqUGMMbXjmVqFR.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu1o5S-W1BAt6E7W7EFfhXzGt6Nd.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmOS2Nzynw69upn7xfS3Ggg0TZgo.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLn7bLadzXv2-BmB04soPkX9kP7.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj1vkZlaPshKW0VHxHuXKKGDuAdD.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoAP9J5VrQDkrHB4BUWUZZcPCVu8.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiVecsn6bQlDaT2hTix_79I5cZ1M.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRlJEMAzhu4RrTX7SM2MIBbOqC7.JPG"><p><span>本期主播：老王 托粒</span></p><p><span>后期：托粒  拍摄：老王 封面：老王</span></p>]]></description>
