  <item>
    <title>S4E10 武夷山，一湾清泉，一座小庙，一餐烟火</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a3010754233e62bc54a625d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a3010754233e62bc54a625d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 14:51:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>杨梅暴雷，今年的杨梅还能吃吗？</span></p><p><span>由福建引出了老王最近去过的武夷山</span></p><p><span>武夷山是世界文化与自然双遗产</span></p><p><span>武夷山的水清澈，鱼在水中可以长得很大</span></p><p><span>它还是乌龙茶和红茶的发源地，真实的茶园比景区更吸引人</span></p><p><span>80年代三得利的广告片就在武夷山拍摄</span></p><p><span>自驾游可以去1号公路</span></p><p><span>在仍然居住着原住民的城村</span></p><p><span>一座寺庙呈现朴实僧人的生活</span></p><p><span>城村码头、老城记忆、牛肉面、人力车</span></p><p><span>都是来自武夷山的故事~</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nrVMzYkE8tdFolNLi5e727YOtR8r.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FifjgscNtY-6fmtDCWWn-RFro1xB.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2e1gaswI1e67-1wl5-v-imkMqS.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nsX_hnCX7GryE5U5GfW9EW64XvrY.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/nomdzUfdvNPz0xNBut82VRfntW07.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FszfoJ9Qcqk0PZnn0Zk-OmO_b0D8.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp3fp1tD_G6W7Uat8ExRSF-F_uWc.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQph2OocU3rw0SFvW_46HbxH7Qg.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv4cgBbcJqYIlE1rsTRrMLtKuueZ.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUJvJIX0-tEOoKdWQWHQ6V43i5g.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtBy3kAedmEiuJ6cQhan4qMYrchr.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFpI05Z7bco7j09jNKPWbzvd9dE.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fstyt3E8P2XjXsIf_PnI-QoBgjZM.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlzNS0DIqtb_xySyTopdhMX5Ln7m.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flg1PepysmqAIn-S0XfG1TrI8AQi.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkaTUgzvPOO626WQw4w8x1M7AIp.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoxlE5pFrNqLLzDEYF3TE_kyLaIx.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-tIEyPX6qlajA0OXFw_D7Vjo6G.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/npGLGyT11xHwP_rYcROaHl08qYip.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNsR_s7WomY5-b64lypNFknDPm8.JPG"><p></p><p><span>本期主播：老王 托粒</span></p><p><span>后期：托粒  封面：老王</span></p>]]></description>
