  <item>
    <title>S4E07 商业化多年，大理不好玩？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d391d8e2c8be31557cf83c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d391d8e2c8be31557cf83c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Apr 2026 11:09:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期咱们聊聊大理。虽然越来越多人说大理不好玩了，但每年依然有上亿人流到达大理。第一次去大理，直飞还是很少，高铁似乎更好。可以住在大理古城，也可以选择民宅，在大理便宜又好的旅居民宿也有很多。坐巴士环洱海，领略100多公里美丽海岸线，当然最好的环洱海还是骑行。不去景点，在洱海边，随便找个小村子也很美好。大理的能量场就是那么舒适。在这一期，还谈到了养老，大理也许是个合适养老的地方。龙龛码头、苍山徒步、古城酒吧......无论好坏都是不错的体验。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6Wmc7PO_hEPSH5FEhxZixRSDvM.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh85N6x5OSDXNSVQPMYhtQG-D8KP.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvRcJPz35UbVfH7y4ggpTxftgPLW.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOJ3Hz67IkcyrQMLbg4nFDYSNNo.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1kRGnrZEG3IqswPFFed12Ti3Cz.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvRAYDRhZnIq5XoQtjkVSyljBOIA.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrP93wnIr-vGqF6m7ab6S7NZ7zkP.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpInG_DwbSeY-TsYlFJM-vZBadri.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luNsIDjqixJjgkV7nntCTqWjNjXa.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfNwzMtC-3Z1ztr8Sj1uCkDLKzf.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQxhisvxMLJfBokNM_Tfs5GcNrS.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVCcCOkHb3RH5mNILDq-PBSYCmY.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrqexKbkIf1C7SxBVITlt79rPeaw.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkNM30ZEUncz5N8cyo_bx8rh2D4B.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKYGVBUJdt-kBixFAGpsgMQuwfl.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2IjaFa_zatyzN7zhfYqK1JNHtC.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRvzoRHJlMlDFUo6ymYBmmfvXql.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzc