    <guid isPermaLink="false">698f31e3a22480add60e1c8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Feb 2026 14:37:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>北京，是熟悉又陌生的双重存在。它曾承载过无数人的青春与梦想——在那里求学、就业、奔赴前程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于亲临天安门升旗仪式，国歌响起的刹那，那份庄严依然令人动容。从天安门广场的升旗仪式，到故宫、国博、毛主席纪念堂的深度探访；从天坛的祈年殿到南锣鼓巷的烟火气，再到环球影城的梦幻释放。清华、北大、中央美院、798、中国美术馆，串联起学院路与艺术区；再延伸至八达岭长城、香山、颐和园的冬日沉静，以及地安门深处的胡同肌理。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不止于行走。后海的波光曾映照中国摇滚乐的草创年代，颐和园的雪覆盖着皇家园囿的寂静。本期节目是兼具攻略质地与城市感知的记录，也是理解北京的另一种方式。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLghY0Wjz0vvihZRkXwKN_YQ7fE.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnHjBJfZ-BNZpMcYFX7WapEM9XsZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRdDjMaMA50vbp6j34p10oYdyo0.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgB2E3CtAW-5mGeTBZaTkutX9Uz.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcHILsB2jCqaf87g3Px6wohri-W.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljzRQriA5XUtmfFAcX1RDjjjDLI8.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgOkTS0fGikB0iW33eJPfMNyAnU.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4GgrglA6CUn-qgpBm1H4WqvVCw.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FptNfK4YoxQHgygMOtMw2lP30K-5.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgoe1RG9LGjZJCpFiLsyeUCFbNFc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjgUiQ2sDLm9NEDEmP0ZK4b38ohf.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmUNjbGNQJw_Qkq-WAN21dHcILF8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2igzdAt43KQo_Kle8ykXjw-5us.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrADCLsRLrdr5z3N18vaC232YbVr.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fug7idCfvrvA-cosZYJY-W3vU4dZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5teaJaGuIs8rA_ZwrB4t-Vdxxu.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhdXemEfhOxxYh_Y44G1dwzQWvL6.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgw2WmtZ-JOXddUnXalHRQg7GSfV.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEynbh9fUQqYPsw-iMh2-ywKVj7.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgt1aGF8L6eQVEGo0V1wkJosl0np.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播：老王 托粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：托粒 &nbsp;封面：老王</span></p>]]></description>
