  <item>
    <title>S4E02 出藏—这个麦当劳不好吃，但过了这个坎，人生尽是坦途</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6926cd33f8a9e1d162896c7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6926cd33f8a9e1d162896c7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Nov 2025 10:03:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI，大家，进藏之后还要出藏，当G318和G317在国庆期间变成巨大的停车场，老王选择了一条地图上并不显眼的路——川藏中线，完成了一次从拉萨到映秀的反向穿越。这并非一场舒适的观光，而是一场与荒野、与自我对话的公路冒险。川藏中线是由G349、G214及数条省道拼接而成的“非官方”路线。车流极少，能体验真正的“在路上”的孤独感。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqcLAK8DA3AJykfYCuAuYgsiG0d3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>1：从圣城到高原湿地——拉萨至嘉黎</span></p><span></span><p><span>从拉萨出发，经墨竹工卡转入G349，到达海拔4488米的嘉黎县，首站即高能，这里是黑颈鹤的保护区。傍晚时分，牧场、牦牛群、红霞与彩虹共同构成了一幅高原生态画卷。在地藏餐馆体验牦牛肉火锅，是抵御高寒与融入当地的最佳方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2：夜行与冰川——嘉黎至边坝</span></p><span></span><p><span>夜穿嘉黎至边坝，路况良好但需全程警惕横穿马路的牦牛。路过炯拉措冰川融湖，穿越千年沙棘林，和与当地淳朴藏民的短暂交流，是旅程中温暖的人文注脚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3：奇峰与终极挑战——洛隆至“麦当劳线”</span></p><span></span><p><span>洛隆段：远观形如“五指山”或“玉指山”的奇特山峰，感叹自然的鬼斧神工。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“麦当劳线”：（贡觉至白玉段，约160公里）绝大部分为非铺装路面，连续翻越海拔4600米以上的垭口。密集的深水冲沟、炮弹坑，对车辆和驾驶技术是极大考验。这段路耗时约6小时，是全程中最为硬核和难忘的一段。</span></p><span></span><p><span>4：驶入川西，温柔收官</span></p><span></span><p><span>穿过白玉，正式进入四川西部。丹巴藏寨的炊烟与碉楼，让风尘仆仆的旅途终于有了一种“归来”的温柔感。最终经映秀镇，驶出川西高原，完成整个穿越。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi3UQMQNbjmhcnfsNiB-KmMOONjs.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlsDU7GQrpZ_uU4ZgyrDISulArjE.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgVSLJlZMROSgGdfeQtdQ7yUJ_PR.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiAV8gDeJmhSU8oH-kQii3HrGrrb.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsi0Ur0ozL-ogAL47JODdxEoKUTL.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshvtMVYOHV3nB01tdSYyI5vb9Sc.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOp4zktw8W_iQRft4sKzUVAamGh.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtaiZUllBjakwZqYlPi6rUS13XSj.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo3kq26vXhI-hYdDBZizxo_Ns7S0.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAehtPzy6S_QrnPfk_11t5ZtTdj.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5LhAki0a8hi8O8hCh1QxMyglLA.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJZ2t9rrT-edBSzl_1bNfxuEdqw.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgj_l2sVEZrdHyi5USxAJemVjMYT.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr2FLPJE6SiYYq59AUib92_o47tW.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FirsRSU3CY5nrS3WV143PQYIE_Ei.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FveIcabYqW21hFZwqsJxUF02ccLy.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqbGIMfY493rCf05OhZ-iczYdhd0.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgww_uJA9Pw0Y2XF8X04K8q8GZ0Y.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPNObvXqW9eT0ceHu0w80P_7OcR.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpoM-drpeNDx4P8OYi4AB6axvkyL.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrjkafyvsKXyN2B6rW25wIawAQHT.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Furppk86uBA3w5ZtwhA0g7wCzen0.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldLLhuim3lCzQybBRHX2EcWn8fA.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtvUtubtMRdePNhR0aOHb5e6IMP1.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgoea6ig1MILZNBVxDbjV3WQkOYb.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrkGNCm1BTtFli2Tc6PWvdN0ZduI.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnYi53x_42M5H5zRJ4eXe4se_UCh.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsg3FHzwElq63Yg17WDZCCSd0LEl.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkdKxNCr0ck8VpNMwYup33ZwsMH8.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmieZYZQNhAZynuf-5UNV