    <title>S4E01 行走318，在神山与美措之间，找到“人间值得”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691607e56018cc2c98b9a6fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691607e56018cc2c98b9a6fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HI，大家，我们回来了，经过慎重考虑，我们决定将节目更名为「大地驿站」，这个名字更加贴近我们的内容，也更加能表达我们做播客的初衷。第四季，会有更多的大地故事，话不多说，上车吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>立了Flag，就该去实现它！国道318，一个让无数人魂牵梦绕的名字，一条被称作“人生必走”的进藏路线。今年，老王终于踏上了这段向往已久的旅程。住进充满温度的当地民宿，与淳朴的藏民畅谈人生；在路上偶遇自由奔跑的野生动物，感受生命与自然的共鸣；追寻先辈与先烈的足迹，心中升起深深的敬畏。翻越巍峨高山，穿过幽深隧道，眼前是神山的庄严，美措的清澈——每一步，都像在翻阅人生的不同章节。有艰辛，有挑战，但更多的是无法言说的美好与触动。这不仅是地理的穿越，更是一场心灵的洗礼。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAE0RZsx9KIVKuyUir14AtJAX5Y.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmSmF0B9g4x83eGZnmK3L5iYeN6M.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft4a-oMRi9qTg7fph1atnIee7nW4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftx0fXgTTMF-dgiKRebsrOdIHMng.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlC9SGi4p_4VVVwoufhG0iDUiubx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ful9EyCX48TTBdP11fKjabww9XgT.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgaVVOpBAXaheZF5AmFTcuolxAmX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnuvoDguUjjv5s1rUImzcZNBPOd7.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtXEuV9I3Mz0HglOLTTsiMqCA5Sx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqCM4nE9pw4lLE46QHIDVCRgdLo9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiLQ5FjyC_FtGWSW3-2LcIR8R43w.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fga1rfx5jLEOrttI6IKL8ipMY0zA.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs3g6RM1RCla9PVWHGBYA-zQFXn5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frq_fK1clTs6nm_EgZBb3RKbEkft.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiel8qCYj3Mk8SAvwnr6udPcT8P2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPfvFsm43hi4GuqUmrMZ13Thb3V.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnCaoFuQQo9QzhCY02VnIy534M7k.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrLQV8S_Wyk_Zh9icGQ5FfB_3jOP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpa9wBarDM4uUyhCrxzNdLIHFA-P.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkiEj1r2bLmtQEcU4i61MR6rGa6L.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrVUN5Z3FS9ciPURXfYNAkVIPhIM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtEfYpm5MJ_lH_otqqEeu-Hxo2i.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2YlslZ4b1cQ0q2vvP_01Iec6B0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVcJ16m4ftbzxzQArDbqirt4NYB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fim24BwYv717Ur-52NXThK1UqNZb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsmkn3MmuWBKEbL4-XbyB4v44wdH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmCDBuP1_Av1_tIHizhoRnGsurij.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgyP9tHpTnjkkM7QvKfnYe5Ybjas.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjbNf09Q64oFbqRDcFN3AXbDFxBs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBFuYc4cH6CwSY8h3Qe_euzvdwx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6DN7RCnKXVrbVGts7XVMTTSUHD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8hnUgm3n_K1loBzz8C6Rgi53s2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8T0s6ajn1QSf2rBu6Rgeq2xh0o.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FveHOkn2H1ngdp3x32PbvSzusjlC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtwjL5HAdR1WDKIRw_7Jont40daf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期主播：老王 托粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：托粒 &nbsp;封面：老王</span></p>]]></description>
